  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "\"Silas 'Dry Squack' McQuackerton wasn't always bone dry. Once, he led raids for DRIP from atop Subchain City's tallest head-bobbing tower. Now, haunted by the plague and the faces of those he couldn't save, he seeks redemption, one desperate squack at a time.\"",
    "class": "Plague Vigilante",
    "name": "Silas 'Dry Squack' McQuackerton",
    "personality": "Haunted: Silas is constantly reminded of his past failures, making him hesitant in crucial moments. Determined: Despite his internal struggles, he pushes forward, driven by a fierce desire for redemption. Stoic: Silas rarely shows emotion, a defense mechanism built over years of loss and hardship.",
    "specialAbility": {
      "description": "\"Plague Purge\": Silas unleashes a wave of frigid cryo-energy, freezing and potentially slowing enemies in a small area. He sacrifices some of his own health to channel the energy. The Clan Hollowbeak Beads help him maintain control over the necrotic energies involved, preventing an all-out explosion of ice.",
